<title>RUSSIA: Russian monthly PPI rise slows to 1.4 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Russian monthly PPI rise slows to 1.4 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 1.4 percent in March after 1.6 percent in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  MAR 97    FEB 97    MAR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +1.4	+1.6	+2.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +20.1     +21.4     +89.7</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
